pilot-link -- Palm Handheld Glue

Libraries and bindings for communication with Palm handhelds.

Used by jpilot and others.

pilot-link was originally written by Kenneth Albanowski
<kjahds@kjahds.com> and others and is maintained by
David Desrosiers.

The package includes approx. 40 optional userspace "conduits" that may
be useful (though they're not needed for jpilot). To build them, set 

CONDUITS=yes

before running the SlackBuild. They will install to /usr/bin with
names like "pilot-xxx"

To build the static libraries, set STATIC=yes.
